#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm
msgid "B<-p>, B<--pid>"
msgstr "B<-p>, B<--pid>"

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm
msgid "Interpret the succeeding arguments as process IDs (the default)."
